// Cloud Putt: nine holes of mini golf on one floating cloud island. Press anywhere, drag back
// (the dotted line points the other way, its length and the meter give the power) and let go to
// putt. Felt greens with height fields that curve the ball, wooden borders, a windmill whose sails
// block its tunnel in rhythm, a brook with a bridge, sliding gates, a jump over a cloud gap, two
// tiers, bumpers, a banked dogleg and a crown. Water or the gap: +1 stroke and the ball comes back.
// At most 6 strokes a hole. A round is the nine holes; the next click starts a new one. The camera
// glides from hole to hole. Pointer only (touch: a press, a drag, a release); demo mode plays
// itself. The physics is mirrored by models/course/sim.py (keep the two in step).
